sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Git as Git commit
  participant CI as Pipeline 1842
  participant Worker
  participant BR as Authorized lab target
  participant Peer as Test Peer
  participant Telemetry
  participant Alert
  Git->>CI: Commit 0123456 starts pipeline
  CI->>Worker: Deploy image digest with CHG-2026-0120
  Worker->>Telemetry: Emit deployment-start annotation
  Worker->>BR: Apply approved scenario intent
  BR-->>Worker: Configuration accepted
  BR->>Telemetry: Interface and OSPF events
  Worker->>Peer: Validate route and reachability
  Peer-->>Worker: Operational result
  Worker->>Telemetry: Emit deployment result and evidence link
  alt Required state converges
    Telemetry-->>CI: Observation window healthy
  else Adjacency or reachability fails
    Telemetry->>Alert: Correlated network-impact condition
    Alert-->>CI: Block promotion and attach runbook
  end
